          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most kitchen granite, Miracle 511 Impregnator is the safe, proven choice. If you cook with a lot of oil or have a light, open-grained slab, spend more on Tenax Hydrex. If solvent fumes are a problem in your home, StoneTech BulletProof gives nearly the same protection with water-based convenience.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
